  "body": "https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-nodeiterator\n\n> 4. If **next** **is not** an inclusive ancestor of **root**, set the referenceNode attribute to next and terminate these steps. \n\nThis should be:\n\n> 4. If **root** **is** an inclusive ancestor of **next**, set the referenceNode attribute to next and terminate these steps. \n\nOtherwise you will end up with the following node of the iterator's `root`. Firefox and Chrome seem to behave in line with this fix.\n",
